      "summary": {
        "headline": "Long-term and recent comparative summary of advertising mail received per household from FY2005 to FY2023",
        "statements": [
          {
            "text": "For All households, advertising-mail-received-per-household fell by 462.8 pieces per household per year across the FY2007, FY2008, FY2010, and FY2014 methodology breaks from FY2005 to FY2023.",
            "metric": "advertising-mail-received-per-household",
            "years": [
              2005,
              2023
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "For All households, advertising-mail-received-per-household fell by 213.2 pieces per household per year across the FY2014 methodology break from FY2013 to FY2023.",
            "metric": "advertising-mail-received-per-household",
            "years": [
              2013,
              2023
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "For All households, advertising-mail-received-per-household fell by 156.0 pieces per household per year from FY2018 to FY2023.",
            "metric": "advertising-mail-received-per-household",
            "years": [
              2018,
              2023
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "For the income segment $35K to $65K, advertising-mail-received-per-household fell by 223.6 pieces per household per year from FY2014 to FY2023.",
            "metric": "advertising-mail-received-per-household",
            "years": [
              2014,
              2023
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "For the income segment Over $100K, advertising-mail-received-per-household fell by 457.6 pieces per household per year from FY2014 to FY2023.",
            "metric": "advertising-mail-received-per-household",
            "years": [
              2014,
              2023
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "For the age segment Under 35, advertising-mail-received-per-household fell by 208.0 pieces per household per year from FY2014 to FY2023.",
            "metric": "advertising-mail-received-per-household",
            "years": [
              2014,
              2023
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "For the education segment College graduate, advertising-mail-received-per-household fell by 301.6 pieces per household per year from FY2014 to FY2023.",
            "metric": "advertising-mail-received-per-household",
            "years": [
              2014,
              2023
            ]
          }
        ],
        "caveats": [
          "Prior to 2007, Standard mail volumes were inflated by about 3 billion pieces due to a double count of Detached Address Labels in the Carrier Cost System, whose volumes are the control for the survey results.",
          "Volumes through 2007 were understated by about 2 to 3 billion pieces due to a change in the methodology used by the carrier cost system for estimating deliveries to residential addresses.",
          "Beginning in 2010, diary data were restated because of changes in weighting methodology.",
          "The FY2014 report began weighting by home ownership and restated 2012-2013 in its appendix.",
          "From the FY2024 report, results are published as pieces per household per year, and the survey contractor changed from NuStats to RCF.",
          "FY2025 used a new survey design, renamed the Household Mail Survey.",
          "Projections need at least 8 consecutive annual values; this series has fewer, so none is shown."
        ]
      },
